er" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">24 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Tainted Caress </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Lowers an opponent&#39;s Agility score, and on attack there is a chance you will capture a piece of the creatures soul as an essence item. This essence item is used in pet summons </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">25 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Fetid Grasp </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Disease melee damage </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">26 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Infernal Pact </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Wards damage on groupmember and grants lifetap proc ability until ward is used up </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">26 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Tainted Sacrament </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Summons a single pet for 30 seconds to attack an opponent. Similiar to EQ1 swarm pet. Uses one tainted essence (from 24, Tainted Caress </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">27 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Decripit Slam </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Shield required bash. Stuns and does Disease damage </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">27 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Condeming Spirit </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Ranged Disease DD </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Cruel Intent </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">PBAoE Disease damage instant, plus Slashing damage DOT </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">28 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Consume Vitae </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Lifetap. Disease based damage </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Sorrow </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Attack that requires two handed weapon </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">29 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Painbringer </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Swing-like attack that lowers enemy Strength </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Lucan&#39;s Pact </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Lowers offensive skills, raises defensive skills, resistances, and gives undead form </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">30 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Draw Strength </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Similiar to Siphon Strength in EQ1, taps enemy Strength and delivers it to self </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">31 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Disease Cloud </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Taunt + small but very quick acting Disease DOT </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Paladin/Shadowknight</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">31.6 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Grant of Armament </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Give some of your AC to another party member </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">32 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Evasive Manuevers </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Buff on others to give chance to block/parry blows meant for them. Raises parry skill </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">32 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Grim Sword </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Melee based attack. Damage type is Disease. High damage &amp; power cost. Good for burn </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">33 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Contract of Shadows </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Strength, Stamina, and Agility buff. Self or groupmembers, uses 1 Concentration per target </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">33 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Spiked Boot </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Piercing damage attack </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">34 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Malefic Touch </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Instant Disease DD. 30 min reuse </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">35 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Swarming Spirits </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">PBAoE Disease DD + Lifetap </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">36 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Vile Coil </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Disease DOT. Short duration, good damage </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">37 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Insatiable Hunger </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Increases Offensive skills and grants lifetap proc to entire group </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">38 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Unholy Aura </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Weapon proc abilitiy. Procs are Disease damage. Uses Concentration </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight </font></td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">38 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Cursed Caress </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row1.jpg">Lowers an opponent&#39;s Agility score, and on attack there is a chance you will capture a piece of the creatures soul as an essence item. This essence item is used in pet summons </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">39 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Baleful Smite </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row2.jpg">Disease damage melee attack. If hits, launches extra small AE Disease damage </td></tr><tr><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg"><font size="-6">Shadowknight</font> </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">40 </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">Dreadful Wrath </td><td valign="middle" align="center" background="textures/row3.jpg">High damage Disease DD. Also slows movement of enemy, using 1 concentration while active </td></tr></tbody></table>
	
